      <title>Alibaba Raises $10 Bln in Record Hong Kong Share Sale</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-08-24/alibaba-raises-10-bln-in-record-hong-kong-share-sale-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">62507f4a579b699a01e765b0</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 06:43:52 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Alibaba raised HK$80 billion ($10.2 billion) in Hong Kong’s biggest secondary share sale. The online retail giant-turned-AI player sold 710 million shares at HK$112.7 each. Its shares slid as much as 10% Monday morning, their steepest drop since April 2025. Bloomberg's Anthony Stephens reports.
(Source: Bloomberg)</description>
